*> Implementation test of the Nether's dimension rules (core/src/nether-37-1.cob; T1623 to T1632; docs/protocol/37-nether-1 sections 2 to 6, worked examples 8 and validation V1 to V5, V8):
*> the scalar fields and attribute flags of the dimension type, the text values and tags, infiniburn, lava flow (tick delay, slope, drop-off, current 0.007), the brightness curve
